      },
      "rationale": "The subject-selection handler records focus intent and keeps the walked reads only when options request keepTree. The explicit offer to open task context after refusal begins with keep false and clears chosen context/page selection. The retained walkFresh cases preserve every outline row during refusal and test the task-context reset; All changes is now a comparison-viewer action whose return preserves the walk without a subject read, not a resetting subject selection.",
